    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881830/extras/73e2c06a209b4990033af9f098fcb657.poster.avif?t=1747128894\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881830/extras/73e2c06a209b4990033af9f098fcb657.webm?t=1747128894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881830/extras/73e2c06a209b4990033af9f098fcb657.mp4?t=1747128894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Citizen</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Citizen is a first person narrative comedy game (absurdist narrator-fetish) about \u201chow to deal with important subjects without saying anything\u201d. Featuring completed sentences, the game transcends the bare minimum steam requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURING MULTIPLE TASTE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it your way! Depending on your taste, you might dislike this game while others might enjoy it. We have worked hard to maintain this freedom while keeping all of the content exactly the same regardless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0fThe game transcends the human realm utilizing a completely unnecessary sound production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f015 mins of playtime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaaMany cool doors to pass through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc76Several babies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881830/extras/284f235c7d2a4c0f9dd616a2444836af.avif?t=1747128894\" width=200 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hi, it's SkyBrave! I make short games every month! Join my Discord channel to stay connected!</i></strong></p>",
